WEBVTT

00:17.580 --> 00:19.580
(Byeon Woo Seok)

00:21.150 --> 00:22.348
(CEO)

00:22.349 --> 00:23.349
(10 missed calls from CEO)

00:25.919 --> 00:27.919
(Kim Hye Yoon)

00:34.629 --> 00:37.929
(Lovely Runner)

00:44.529 --> 00:46.600
It's quiet in the alley

00:48.639 --> 00:49.700
Isn't that Sun Jae?

00:51.670 --> 00:52.709
Oh, my!

00:54.539 --> 00:57.138
Sorry.

00:57.139 --> 00:58.279
That's my mom's voice.

00:59.980 --> 01:01.310
I was going to walk past them quietly.

01:04.819 --> 01:06.648
You know, what you're doing is so sweet and all.

01:06.649 --> 01:09.190
Why are you doing it under that bright streetlamp?

01:09.560 --> 01:11.160
You must have gotten a girlfriend.

01:11.730 --> 01:13.630
- Hello.
- Youth is a blissful phase.

01:14.359 --> 01:15.528
I'll let you finish up.

01:15.529 --> 01:17.200
I didn't see anything. I couldn't see a thing.

01:28.679 --> 01:30.709
Gosh, Sun Jae.

01:30.740 --> 01:33.179
Does he want to kiss a girl right in front of his house?

01:33.309 --> 01:35.520
That's so embarrassing. Seriously.

01:37.919 --> 01:39.189
I knew he wouldn't be shy about it...

01:39.190 --> 01:41.220
when he rented an adult movie as a high schooler.

01:41.619 --> 01:43.690
Seriously. Goodness.

01:46.229 --> 01:49.059
(Episode 11)

01:49.160 --> 01:50.360
What am I going to do now?

01:53.830 --> 01:55.839
Sun Jae. Don't worry.

01:55.970 --> 01:57.669
I'll keep you safe no matter what.

01:57.800 --> 01:58.910
I'm not talking about that.

02:00.069 --> 02:01.809
What if your mother thinks poorly of me?

02:03.440 --> 02:05.179
- What?
- Should I tell her it was you?

02:06.709 --> 02:07.910
Or will that make her angrier?

02:08.550 --> 02:10.079
Hey. You were...

02:10.080 --> 02:12.019
worried about that? Is that important to you?

02:12.020 --> 02:13.089
It's very important.

02:17.220 --> 02:18.659
How can you smile right now?

02:18.660 --> 02:19.729
Why?

02:19.860 --> 02:21.660
Am I not allowed to smile because I found out that...

02:22.160 --> 02:23.229
I would die after 15 years?

02:23.300 --> 02:25.399
How can you say that as if it's nothing?

02:25.970 --> 02:28.298
I'm worried that it will come true if I say it out loud.

02:28.299 --> 02:30.340
So I can't even talk about it. How could you...

02:34.169 --> 02:35.609
I won't die that young.

02:35.940 --> 02:38.280
So whatever happens to me in the future,

02:38.549 --> 02:40.410
don't ever think that it's your fault.

02:46.889 --> 02:48.150
So this is the last time?

02:50.560 --> 02:51.729
When will you go back?

02:53.489 --> 02:54.660
I'm not sure.

02:55.299 --> 02:57.060
Maybe, I have a month left.

02:58.470 --> 02:59.669
Can you not go back?

03:06.870 --> 03:07.970
I guess you have to go back.

03:13.350 --> 03:14.509
Then...

03:16.350 --> 03:17.819
when you go back to the future after a month,

03:18.720 --> 03:19.819
let's meet there.

03:25.829 --> 03:27.259
I'll be running diligently...

03:27.590 --> 03:28.759
to the Year 2023...

03:29.530 --> 03:30.829
where you will be.

03:43.440 --> 03:45.749
Being on the plane for over ten hours...

03:45.750 --> 03:46.810
must be exhausting for him.

03:47.810 --> 03:50.850
Well, I got him a business seat. Will he be okay?

03:52.150 --> 03:54.989
Even at 50 years old, I've never had the chance to fly business class.

03:55.960 --> 03:57.788
The in-flight meals must be good. Right?

03:57.789 --> 04:00.229
What is it? Your son is all grown up.

04:00.430 --> 04:02.358
Are you that sad you can't see him for a few months?

04:02.359 --> 04:04.859
Gosh. He may be all grown up, but he's still a kid to me.

04:06.569 --> 04:10.000
Other than a few days of the off-season training,

04:10.840 --> 04:12.970
he had never been away from me for this long all his life.

04:14.069 --> 04:15.909
I pampered my son,

04:15.910 --> 04:17.509
so he never felt the absence of his mother.

04:17.940 --> 04:21.449
Once he gets married later, your effort won't mean anything.

04:33.690 --> 04:35.759
(Recipient: Im Sol)

04:35.760 --> 04:36.858
Are you still up?

04:36.859 --> 04:37.900
(Your message was sent to Im Sol.)

04:40.869 --> 04:42.369
(Contacts)

04:45.439 --> 04:47.309
(Sol)

05:06.129 --> 05:07.289
(Contacts, Sol)

05:11.499 --> 05:12.729
(Contacts, Sol)

05:28.780 --> 05:30.020
I need to...

05:31.479 --> 05:33.150
take good care of myself for the next 15 years.

05:43.330 --> 05:45.169
In Hyuk must have left some behind.

05:49.770 --> 05:50.799
There it is.

06:00.450 --> 06:02.350
I'm still up. How come you're still up?

06:03.179 --> 06:04.720
She's just so unbelievably cute.

06:16.460 --> 06:18.200
My phone charger is in the luggage.

06:37.320 --> 06:38.850
Gosh.

06:40.650 --> 06:42.460
Now that my son isn't here,

06:43.559 --> 06:45.229
the house feels so empty.

06:50.960 --> 06:53.999
Gosh. I forgot to close the door.

06:56.799 --> 06:59.439
It's scarier because the house is big.

07:00.570 --> 07:03.210
Gosh. Whatever. I should wash my feet and go to sleep.

07:16.419 --> 07:17.460
(Circuit breaker)

07:21.590 --> 07:22.600
What was that?

07:53.260 --> 07:54.330
Who is that?

07:58.359 --> 07:59.369
Who's there?

08:08.739 --> 08:09.840
Dad!

08:11.679 --> 08:13.280
Dad!

08:13.549 --> 08:15.080
Oh, no. What do I do?

08:16.020 --> 08:17.179
Dad!

08:20.049 --> 08:22.220
- In front of your house?
- Yes.

08:22.789 --> 08:24.260
I'm not sure.

08:24.359 --> 08:26.128
But it was the same truck...

08:26.129 --> 08:27.489
Kim Young Soo was driving to chase me.

08:31.200 --> 08:32.998
Could you check on it?

08:32.999 --> 08:34.169
I'll check on it right away.

08:35.229 --> 08:37.298
Gather all the security footage around the house of the victim...

08:37.299 --> 08:38.970
in Kim Young Soo's attempted abduction.

08:39.140 --> 08:40.640
If you see a white truck in it, track its route.

08:44.039 --> 08:45.450
Stop running away from me.

08:46.210 --> 08:47.450
Just pursue your feelings for me.

09:01.560 --> 09:03.859
Can I do that?

09:05.430 --> 09:09.670
Dad!

09:09.769 --> 09:10.839
Oh, no.

09:10.840 --> 09:11.869
Dad!

09:19.279 --> 09:20.379
It's Sun Jae!

09:20.479 --> 09:21.749
It's your son! Ryu Sun Jae!

09:22.720 --> 09:24.220
- You startled me.
- My son?

09:26.590 --> 09:28.790
You should be having the in-flight meal by now.

09:28.889 --> 09:30.489
Why are you still here?

09:30.590 --> 09:32.259
Because I never got on the plane. That's why I'm here.

09:33.460 --> 09:35.499
Dad. Are you okay?

09:35.999 --> 09:38.970
You brat. What's this? Why do you have this on your face?

09:39.399 --> 09:41.600
Are you trying to give your own father a heart attack?

09:41.899 --> 09:43.599
Why didn't you go to the US?

09:43.600 --> 09:45.569
- Why?
- Dad, let me speak then.

09:45.570 --> 09:46.609
Hear me out.

09:46.769 --> 09:48.339
Since everyone wanted me to go,

09:48.340 --> 09:50.509
I was going to give it a shot one last time.

09:51.409 --> 09:53.249
But to be honest, I wasn't sure if I could do it.

09:54.080 --> 09:55.778
Why spend a fortune on the rehabilitation process...

09:55.779 --> 09:57.519
when I was only doing it for other people's sakes?

09:57.619 --> 09:58.950
But still.

09:59.019 --> 10:00.618
Getting a spot in the process...

10:00.619 --> 10:02.389
was difficult even for talented athletes.

10:02.619 --> 10:04.189
That kind of chance doesn't come often.

10:04.190 --> 10:06.560
How could you waste that on a whim like that? You brat!

10:06.729 --> 10:08.930
When I thought about swimming again,

10:09.300 --> 10:11.399
I no longer felt passionate about it like I was before.

10:11.960 --> 10:13.499
I thought I still wanted it,

10:14.670 --> 10:15.800
but I guess I didn't.

10:16.340 --> 10:17.940
I must have closed that chapter pretty tightly.

10:22.779 --> 10:23.909
Are you sure...

10:25.239 --> 10:26.950
you won't regret this?

10:27.249 --> 10:28.350
Yes.

10:28.950 --> 10:32.350
So what do you plan on doing with your life then?

10:32.389 --> 10:34.190
I'm only 20 years old, Dad.

10:34.590 --> 10:36.060
I'll take some time to look into...

10:36.290 --> 10:37.619
what I want to do with my life.

10:37.690 --> 10:38.989
Gosh. You're so frustrating.

10:39.159 --> 10:41.190
Dad. Who knows?

10:41.259 --> 10:43.729
I might become super famous in a different field...

10:44.159 --> 10:45.970
and end up with so many fans.

10:46.029 --> 10:47.998
Gosh. You are an ambitious one. Aren't you?

10:47.999 --> 10:49.540
Do you think it will be that easy?

10:51.369 --> 10:52.508
Gosh.

10:52.509 --> 10:54.310
Why is my head pounding?

10:54.909 --> 10:56.540
Dad. Do you have a headache?

10:57.540 --> 10:59.550
Oh, right. Your luggage.

11:00.050 --> 11:01.710
What did you do with your luggage?

11:01.779 --> 11:04.879
I left the airport after checking in your luggage.

11:05.149 --> 11:06.289
Did you get it back?

11:06.290 --> 11:08.350
Why is my face so dry? I should apply some lotion.

11:08.519 --> 11:09.560
Yes?

11:09.720 --> 11:11.489
I don't care about your dry skin. What about the luggage?

11:12.129 --> 11:13.460
Hey, you brat!

11:13.690 --> 11:16.658
Not the stir-fried gochujang! That's...

11:16.659 --> 11:18.970
- Face the front and spin them.
- Spin them.

11:19.529 --> 11:22.299
All right. This is a great exercise to lose the fat in your arms.

11:22.300 --> 11:24.840
- Do it while watching TV.
- To the right.

11:24.970 --> 11:26.040
When you spin them like this,

11:26.639 --> 11:28.470
you can spin them 500 times in 10 minutes.

11:30.180 --> 11:31.340
- It's the same as punching...
- The other side.

11:31.440 --> 11:32.450
the sandbag.

11:35.649 --> 11:36.720
Great.

11:37.119 --> 11:38.519
- What was that?
- Face the front.

11:38.950 --> 11:41.189
The faster you spin them, the better workout you will get.

11:41.190 --> 11:44.189
- My gosh. That's so loud.
- All right. This is our 11th move.

11:44.190 --> 11:46.190
- Shouldn't she be having menopause?
- Bend your knees.

11:46.460 --> 11:49.128
- Why is she dancing in the morning?
- Bend your knees.

11:49.129 --> 11:50.998
You have to raise them up next.

11:50.999 --> 11:52.060
- Go.
- A knee strike.

11:52.399 --> 11:53.529
Gosh.

11:53.629 --> 11:56.769
To live a long and healthy life, I ought to exercise.

11:56.869 --> 11:59.009
- Don't you agree, Mom?
- You're totally right.

12:05.009 --> 12:06.009
Right.

12:06.010 --> 12:08.310
Guess what I saw last night.

12:08.550 --> 12:11.279
I saw Sun Jae kissing a girl...

12:11.420 --> 12:12.489
in front of his house.

12:12.550 --> 12:14.050
What? He was kissing a girl?

12:14.749 --> 12:17.358
Don't tell me you stood there and watched him.

12:17.359 --> 12:19.429
Gosh. You're so inconsiderate.

12:19.430 --> 12:21.028
He was doing that out on the street for everyone to watch.

12:21.029 --> 12:22.359
How could I not watch them?

12:22.759 --> 12:24.100
Gosh, that brat.

12:24.229 --> 12:26.170
He has an innocent face and all.

12:26.200 --> 12:28.300
But he's not shy about going after what he wants.

12:28.670 --> 12:30.100
He's not like that!

12:32.639 --> 12:34.269
How do you know if he's not like that or not?

12:34.540 --> 12:36.138
Men are all the same.

12:36.139 --> 12:39.549
Besides, his girlfriend must be just like him.

12:39.550 --> 12:41.350
She followed him all the way to his house.

12:41.509 --> 12:42.779
They weren't alone, you know?

12:45.379 --> 12:48.220
"Muah."

12:49.989 --> 12:51.389
He's not a little kid. He's done nothing wrong.

12:51.820 --> 12:52.858
Well,

12:52.859 --> 12:54.690
when two people like each other, it's okay to kiss.

12:55.060 --> 12:57.829
Your mom is the one to talk. Whenever your mom and your dad...

12:57.830 --> 13:00.429
looked at each other, they started kissing at the wall...

13:00.430 --> 13:02.898
- or wherever they were.
- Gosh. Come on, Mom! Stop it.

13:02.899 --> 13:04.569
Gosh. Her lips were practically attached to his lips.

13:04.570 --> 13:06.440
- Darn it.
- That's how they had you.

13:07.940 --> 13:09.639
Mom, I didn't know your lips were glued to his.

13:18.080 --> 13:20.090
- Hello.
- Hi.

13:22.320 --> 13:23.459
By the way,

13:23.460 --> 13:25.190
your son must have gotten a girlfriend.

13:29.330 --> 13:31.129
- What?
- Well, last night,

13:31.499 --> 13:33.728
I saw him in the alley.

13:33.729 --> 13:35.300
He was with his girlfriend.

13:35.769 --> 13:37.998
- And he was...
- He was what?

13:37.999 --> 13:40.409
Well, he stayed very true to his instincts.

13:40.470 --> 13:43.840
Is it because he watched the movie, "Basic Instincts," many times?

13:43.979 --> 13:46.248
Gosh. He just went for it.

13:46.249 --> 13:48.350
Gosh. Spit it out. What did he do?

13:48.409 --> 13:49.649
Forget it. Gosh.

13:49.820 --> 13:51.619
I should respect your son's fried.

13:51.820 --> 13:54.220
Gosh. Oh, my. He was just...

13:58.060 --> 13:59.659
"Fried" is for fried chicken.

13:59.690 --> 14:00.989
You meant to say "privacy."

14:01.529 --> 14:04.229
So just tell me! What did he do? Come on.

14:07.629 --> 14:09.040
Gosh. This is so frustrating.

14:11.440 --> 14:12.869
- Sun Jae.
- Yes?

14:13.810 --> 14:14.970
You decided...

14:16.040 --> 14:17.909
not to go to the US.

14:18.680 --> 14:21.210
A girl can't be the reason behind not going. Right?

14:21.409 --> 14:22.450
What?

14:26.820 --> 14:28.550
Gosh, it's nothing like that!

14:29.190 --> 14:30.220
I'll be back later.

14:40.070 --> 14:41.199
I knew it.

14:41.200 --> 14:44.170
Swimming was the only thing he had ever been interested in.

14:44.840 --> 14:46.508
She was the one who was mistaken.

14:46.509 --> 14:48.769
How dare she accuse of my innocent boy?

14:48.869 --> 14:49.909
It was a wild accusation at that too.

15:02.960 --> 15:04.158
Someone might see us again.

15:04.159 --> 15:05.259
Let's go now.

15:14.300 --> 15:15.399
Let's go.

15:34.749 --> 15:36.489
What if our classmates see us together?

15:36.659 --> 15:37.690
Then should we hide it?

15:37.820 --> 15:40.330
I'm just not sure if we should be holding hands in public.

15:41.060 --> 15:42.460
Once I go back...

15:49.499 --> 15:51.269
To me, every moment with you is precious.

15:51.840 --> 15:53.609
So let's not conceal our feelings.

15:53.810 --> 15:55.009
Let's not hide from people.

15:55.170 --> 15:56.479
Let's fully follow our hearts.

15:57.879 --> 15:59.580
Once you leave, I'll take care of the mess.

15:59.979 --> 16:01.279
I won't cause any confusion on you.

16:04.950 --> 16:07.019
You're saying that because you want to keep holding hands.

16:07.389 --> 16:08.450
Yes.

16:13.460 --> 16:14.629
Are you still worried?

16:15.690 --> 16:17.960
Fine. If it still makes you uncomfortable,

16:18.200 --> 16:19.229
keep it a secret.

16:20.899 --> 16:22.540
- I got you!
- What?

16:22.600 --> 16:23.800
What's going on with those two?

16:26.769 --> 16:27.940
Are you two dating?

16:28.070 --> 16:29.979
You said you weren't dating!

16:30.040 --> 16:31.779
You traitor!

16:34.879 --> 16:36.519
You said you weren't dating and you guys weren't even close.

16:36.580 --> 16:37.778
You said nothing was going on.

16:37.779 --> 16:39.349
You feigned innocence and hid this from me. What?

16:39.350 --> 16:40.388
"Keep it a secret?"

16:40.389 --> 16:41.450
How could you betray your best friend?

16:41.550 --> 16:44.320
Hey, why are you getting so angry over this?

16:45.420 --> 16:46.989
You're hiding something from me too.

16:48.129 --> 16:49.200
Like what?

16:49.430 --> 16:51.060
I'm not hiding anything from you.

16:51.430 --> 16:52.970
Yes, you are.

16:52.999 --> 16:54.069
You!

16:54.070 --> 16:55.228
You must be nice to me.

16:55.229 --> 16:56.898
I'll keep my eyes on you to see how well you treat her.

16:56.899 --> 16:58.669
So you'd better behave well. Don't even look at other girls.

16:58.670 --> 17:00.008
If you upset her and make her cry,

17:00.009 --> 17:01.269
I'm going to...

17:02.310 --> 17:04.579
My friend saw us together earlier. And he wants a date with you.

17:04.580 --> 17:05.878
Zero, one, one, four, eight, eight, two, eight, four, eight.

17:05.879 --> 17:06.879
What did you say?

17:06.880 --> 17:10.119
Zero, one, one, four, eight, eight, two, eight, four, eight.

17:11.080 --> 17:13.320
Tell your friend to contact me.

17:13.519 --> 17:16.118
Then you two, have a lovely time together.

17:16.119 --> 17:17.590
I'll give you guys privacy.

17:27.070 --> 17:28.770
- You can go now.
- Okay.

17:30.939 --> 17:33.510
What? Are you going to take this lecture for me?

17:33.709 --> 17:34.709
Yes.

17:35.609 --> 17:37.009
Don't you have class today?

17:37.010 --> 17:38.179
I have no class today.

17:38.780 --> 17:40.179
You came to school when you have no class?

17:41.109 --> 17:42.250
It's about to start.

17:43.250 --> 17:44.648
What if the professor finds out?

17:44.649 --> 17:45.649
Be quiet.

17:47.290 --> 17:49.149
There's public distance.

17:49.490 --> 17:50.490
Next.

17:53.490 --> 17:55.560
Take a look at this. It's the depth of field.

17:55.730 --> 17:59.999
It's the distance that allows the objects to be in focus.

18:00.000 --> 18:01.368
- What was that?
- There are different types...

18:01.369 --> 18:02.428
- Pay attention.
- of camera focus.

18:02.429 --> 18:05.570
Deep focus, selective focus, and soft focus.

18:06.070 --> 18:07.139
As for the deep focus,

18:07.540 --> 18:10.439
it's an expressive method where it depicts objects directly.

18:10.740 --> 18:16.080
Moreover, it emphasizes the harmony of the objects.

18:16.179 --> 18:19.149
The realistic mise-en-scene will be important.

18:20.090 --> 18:21.520
Should we have tteokbokki, your favourite?

18:21.719 --> 18:23.189
- Tteokbokki sounds good. Yes.
- Right?

18:24.590 --> 18:25.619
Wait.

18:30.159 --> 18:32.359
Hey. So you didn't go to the US.

18:33.600 --> 18:35.939
- How did you find out?
- Your dad called.

18:36.169 --> 18:37.698
He said he was so frustrated by you.

18:37.699 --> 18:39.340
He complained about you all morning.

18:39.639 --> 18:41.240
You should've told me if you weren't leaving.

18:41.709 --> 18:43.208
You made us audition by ourselves.

18:43.209 --> 18:45.609
Right. How did the audition go?

18:46.480 --> 18:47.550
We passed.

18:47.909 --> 18:49.179
We're here for the final preliminary round.

18:49.550 --> 18:52.350
Had I known you weren't leaving, I would've come here with you.

18:53.320 --> 18:54.419
That's good.

18:54.590 --> 18:56.188
You passed without me last time.

18:56.189 --> 18:57.358
I'm sure you can pass without me again.

18:57.359 --> 18:59.159
Hey, we're up.

19:00.859 --> 19:02.359
Hey, I need to go in now.

19:02.429 --> 19:04.559
Anyway, you have to make up for this.

19:04.560 --> 19:06.429
Okay. I really hope you pass.

19:09.000 --> 19:10.669
- Let's go.
- Okay.

19:12.609 --> 19:14.840
What audition?

19:15.040 --> 19:16.709
Were you going to audition?

19:17.209 --> 19:18.339
Yes.

19:18.340 --> 19:22.010
In Hyuk told me to audition for some show, "Superstar K."

19:23.119 --> 19:24.179
What?

19:24.449 --> 19:26.689
But he passed without you?

19:27.189 --> 19:28.218
Yes.

19:28.219 --> 19:30.020
He's at the final preliminary round now.

19:34.359 --> 19:35.490
No, Sun Jae.

19:36.159 --> 19:37.199
Run.

19:38.929 --> 19:40.469
- Where are we going?
- To the audition.

19:40.899 --> 19:42.668
- What?
- Hurry.

19:42.669 --> 19:44.600
Call In Hyuk. Tell him you're on your way now.

19:44.740 --> 19:46.569
Calm down, Sol.

19:46.570 --> 19:47.939
You must go now!

19:48.139 --> 19:49.310
Going there now won't make a difference.

19:50.480 --> 19:51.639
He said he was up next.

19:52.340 --> 19:53.379
What?

19:54.909 --> 19:55.909
Oh, no.

19:59.990 --> 20:01.320
What do I do?

20:02.619 --> 20:05.560
Why did you sing in front of so many people for something like this?

20:06.929 --> 20:08.629
I must have gone mad.

20:16.040 --> 20:17.169
Why do you look so down?

20:20.609 --> 20:23.310
Was I supposed to audition for the show with In Hyuk?

20:24.939 --> 20:26.080
Am I...

20:26.879 --> 20:28.080
a singer in the future?

20:28.679 --> 20:31.050
If you knew and heard about my song in the future,

20:31.350 --> 20:32.790
I must be pretty famous.

20:34.020 --> 20:36.090
Maybe not anymore.

20:39.929 --> 20:41.159
So what then?

20:46.500 --> 20:48.100
You liked...

20:48.669 --> 20:49.770
singing.

20:52.040 --> 20:54.070
You seemed really happy then.

20:54.810 --> 20:56.209
- Really?
- Yes.

20:58.010 --> 21:00.409
I'm afraid that I might have stolen your joy...

21:00.850 --> 21:05.320
and you might never get a chance to perform on stage because of me.

21:05.820 --> 21:06.850
What if...

21:07.820 --> 21:09.520
I'm not a singer anymore...

21:10.590 --> 21:12.590
when you go back to the future? Will you be disappointed?

21:13.290 --> 21:14.590
Why would I be disappointed?

21:14.659 --> 21:16.100
I'm happy as long as you're happy.

21:16.199 --> 21:17.559
What if I'm a happily unemployed man?

21:17.560 --> 21:18.929
As long as you're happy,

21:19.469 --> 21:20.770
I'll have to take care of you.

21:22.369 --> 21:23.540
That feels reassuring.

21:27.939 --> 21:29.638
Here are two cups of Americano.

21:29.639 --> 21:30.980
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

21:32.780 --> 21:33.850
Really?

21:35.209 --> 21:36.780
What do you do on the days without classes?

21:37.879 --> 21:38.948
I watch movies.

21:38.949 --> 21:40.049
I'm a fan of overseas soccer,

21:40.050 --> 21:42.418
so I stay up all night to watch it when the season starts.

21:42.419 --> 21:43.419
"Overseas soccer?"

21:43.659 --> 21:44.659
Me too.

21:44.859 --> 21:46.020
Are you a fan of Park Ji Sung?

21:46.230 --> 21:47.459
- You too?
- Me too.

21:47.659 --> 21:48.688
- Two...
- Hearts!

21:48.689 --> 21:49.698
- Unstopping...
- Hearts!

21:49.699 --> 21:50.699
- Three...
- Lungs!

21:50.699 --> 21:51.699
- Oxygen...
- Tank!

21:51.700 --> 21:53.369
- Park Ji Sung, rise!
- Rise!

21:55.669 --> 21:58.369
I told her to find another guy, and she quickly did so.

22:00.639 --> 22:02.169
- I'm sorry.
- Hey.

22:02.439 --> 22:03.879
He's in our department, right?

22:04.810 --> 22:06.480
How is he? Is he a nice person?

22:06.980 --> 22:08.510
Cho Rong?

22:09.080 --> 22:11.020
He's a funny, heavy drinker.

22:11.919 --> 22:13.619
His nickname is HDN,

22:14.050 --> 22:15.750
short for Hard-drinking Nutcase.

22:16.090 --> 22:17.219
"HDN."

22:17.859 --> 22:19.759
- Open your mouth.
- The one who likes to drink...

22:19.760 --> 22:20.889
isn't a good guy.

22:21.689 --> 22:23.800
Why did she choose him of all men?

22:24.399 --> 22:25.429
Gosh.

22:25.730 --> 22:27.500
- Hey. Let's go.
- Okay.

22:29.169 --> 22:30.899
That's boiling hot!

22:31.070 --> 22:33.270
- It's not that hot.
- How could you drink it?

22:35.109 --> 22:37.780
- What's so funny about it?
- Stop drinking it.

22:40.350 --> 22:41.709
Wait. No.

22:47.020 --> 22:48.448
You skipped morning classes.

22:48.449 --> 22:49.519
Did you run a marathon or what?

22:49.520 --> 22:51.319
My brother is getting married,

22:51.320 --> 22:52.489
(Always greet politely, Department of Physical Education)

22:52.490 --> 22:53.989
so I got him a honeymoon gift.

22:53.990 --> 22:55.060
What is it?

22:59.230 --> 23:00.569
I went to 100 convenience stores.

23:00.570 --> 23:02.129
My goodness.

23:02.270 --> 23:03.639
You're amazing.

23:05.840 --> 23:07.469
- Hey. If he uses them all...
- I'm sorry.

23:09.740 --> 23:11.340
(Spearhead PE)

23:16.719 --> 23:18.320
(Department of Physical Education)

23:19.889 --> 23:20.990
What are you doing?

23:25.919 --> 23:27.030
Hey, Sun Jae.

23:27.129 --> 23:29.159
You're making a lot of women cry since you got a girlfriend.

23:30.199 --> 23:32.830
I'll also make many women cry once I get a girlfriend.

23:32.899 --> 23:34.770
- What a nonsense.
- Did the blind date go well?

23:35.169 --> 23:36.770
Yes. Thanks, friend.

23:37.439 --> 23:39.869
Hey. Let's go on a double date if it works out well with Hyun Ju.

23:39.969 --> 23:41.708
What? Hey, hold on.

23:41.709 --> 23:44.079
Did you set him on a blind date?

23:44.080 --> 23:45.240
- Are you done?
- Hold on.

23:45.780 --> 23:47.780
Okay. I'll be on my way.

23:47.949 --> 23:48.980
I'll see you in front of the College of Humanities.

23:49.050 --> 23:50.378
- Hey, I'll get going.
- Okay. Bye.

23:50.379 --> 23:52.520
- What?
- Hey, about that blind date...

23:56.990 --> 23:58.020
What are you doing?

23:59.260 --> 24:00.290
Here.

24:03.000 --> 24:04.100
What is this?

24:05.230 --> 24:06.730
- It's cute.
- Tada!

24:07.629 --> 24:09.369
- It's a matching set.
- Yes.

24:12.500 --> 24:14.009
- They are cute.
- They're cute, right?

24:14.010 --> 24:15.040
Yes.

24:35.889 --> 24:36.899
What are you doing?

24:38.129 --> 24:39.159
Don't you know this?

24:39.399 --> 24:41.168
If you catch a falling petal,

24:41.169 --> 24:42.330
they say your wish comes true.

25:20.369 --> 25:22.139
Let's make a wish. Close your eyes.

25:43.800 --> 25:45.129
What did you wish for?

25:46.899 --> 25:47.929
It's a secret.

25:48.899 --> 25:49.899
What about you?

25:51.270 --> 25:53.070
It's a secret too.

25:56.740 --> 25:57.780
But...

25:58.240 --> 26:00.980
I think I already got my wish.

26:02.750 --> 26:03.750
What?

26:08.050 --> 26:09.090
What was that?

26:09.619 --> 26:11.159
What if others see us?

26:20.929 --> 26:21.929
Hey.

26:37.350 --> 26:38.718
Wait until I catch you.

26:38.719 --> 26:39.919
Catch me if you can.

26:43.189 --> 26:44.189
Why?

26:52.800 --> 26:54.369
Why does a day feel so short?

26:54.600 --> 26:55.629
I know.

26:57.139 --> 26:59.000
Go and get some rest, then.

27:03.040 --> 27:04.810
- Do I really have to go home?
- What?

27:05.740 --> 27:07.010
I want to stay with you a little longer.

27:08.010 --> 27:09.050
Can't I?

27:10.649 --> 27:11.649
You can.

27:12.379 --> 27:13.590
What? No.

27:14.719 --> 27:16.050
I mean...

27:16.320 --> 27:19.560
There's no place to go at this hour.

27:20.959 --> 27:22.090
There's a place we can go.

27:24.760 --> 27:25.760
Where?

27:32.639 --> 27:33.969
When are you going to get a hold of yourself?

27:34.070 --> 27:35.510
Don't count your chickens.

27:38.609 --> 27:39.609
What's wrong?

27:40.609 --> 27:41.609
What?

27:43.219 --> 27:44.480
It's nothing.

27:48.320 --> 27:50.119
The ocean is pretty.

27:54.290 --> 27:55.330
Should we go?

27:57.760 --> 27:59.260
To the ocean?

27:59.760 --> 28:01.929
Yes. Let's go and watch the ocean...

28:03.770 --> 28:04.939
before you go back.

28:17.020 --> 28:19.149
Okay. We'll go and watch the ocean.

29:02.290 --> 29:05.859
I just wanted to rewind it a little.

29:06.669 --> 29:09.270
Sure, go ahead. Rewind it.

29:09.500 --> 29:12.399
Roll back about a minute.

29:15.770 --> 29:17.580
Should we roll back a minute too?

29:18.080 --> 29:19.080
What?

29:20.550 --> 29:22.379
If you give me another chance, I'll try my best...

29:22.980 --> 29:24.050
Stop it.

29:24.080 --> 29:26.618
Because you pecked me on the streets before,

29:26.619 --> 29:28.050
I got all confused.

29:29.619 --> 29:30.889
Just keep watching the movie.

29:33.790 --> 29:34.959
It's a shame.

29:50.439 --> 29:51.939
How can you fall asleep right now?

30:15.600 --> 30:17.040
Let's stay like this a bit.

30:18.639 --> 30:19.740
Just a little longer.

30:33.320 --> 30:36.219
(Gold Videos and DVDs)

30:57.409 --> 30:58.609
When did I fall asleep?

31:06.550 --> 31:07.590
Oh, no!

31:09.419 --> 31:10.659
For goodness' sake.

31:25.939 --> 31:27.770
Are you up?

31:30.480 --> 31:31.580
I didn't sleep.

31:32.080 --> 31:33.209
You didn't?

31:36.109 --> 31:37.249
How could I fall asleep?

31:37.250 --> 31:38.750
Why? Did I snore?

31:42.189 --> 31:43.219
Forget it.

31:46.419 --> 31:47.859
Why are you fanning me all of a sudden?

31:48.959 --> 31:51.699
What? Right. Well...

31:52.459 --> 31:56.000
I thought it'd be hot for you.

31:57.000 --> 31:58.040
What?

32:01.709 --> 32:02.939
Why are you grabbing me by the collar?

32:06.780 --> 32:09.009
I think something's on the shirt.

32:09.010 --> 32:10.619
Were you drooling? It's all right.

32:10.719 --> 32:11.750
No.

32:12.919 --> 32:13.949
It's okay.

32:16.419 --> 32:17.590
That Cotton Swab.

32:23.429 --> 32:24.830
I'm sorry. Oh, no.

32:32.240 --> 32:33.340
Actually...

32:33.439 --> 32:34.669
- Son of a gun!
- Geum.

32:34.770 --> 32:35.839
Come on out!

32:35.840 --> 32:39.009
- Come here, jerk!
- What's wrong with you?

32:39.010 --> 32:40.480
Was it you...

32:40.850 --> 32:42.648
who was smooching in the alley?

32:42.649 --> 32:45.218
What did you do with my sister all night long?

32:45.219 --> 32:47.019
Let go, Mom. We didn't do anything.

32:47.020 --> 32:48.218
I didn't do anything.

32:48.219 --> 32:51.590
Then why are you half-naked, jerk?

32:52.060 --> 32:54.329
How dare you grab my son by the collar?

32:54.330 --> 32:56.289
Let go of him!

32:56.290 --> 32:57.359
- Dad.
- Let go!

32:57.530 --> 32:59.300
Gosh. What are you doing?

32:59.429 --> 33:00.530
Dad!

33:02.669 --> 33:03.770
Dad.

33:03.840 --> 33:05.340
How dare you...

33:06.240 --> 33:07.510
Let go of him, I said!

33:08.270 --> 33:09.309
Gosh!

33:09.310 --> 33:10.709
Did you just hit my son?

33:11.439 --> 33:12.439
Did you?

33:12.440 --> 33:14.049
- Mom. Calm down...
- Dad.

33:14.050 --> 33:15.350
- and listen to me.
- Don't stop me!

33:15.409 --> 33:17.149
- Yes. I hit him.
- Dad.

33:17.250 --> 33:20.718
Do I just stand here and watch while my son gets humiliated, then?

33:20.719 --> 33:22.118
"Humiliated?"

33:22.119 --> 33:24.259
Check how your son looks before you say so.

33:24.260 --> 33:26.590
What can be wrong with how he looks?

33:28.790 --> 33:29.959
Well, it's...

33:34.899 --> 33:37.040
Does that mean you two are...

33:39.139 --> 33:40.369
You prick.

33:40.469 --> 33:42.639
Did you not go to the US because of Sol?

33:42.810 --> 33:43.810
That's not it, Dad.

33:43.811 --> 33:46.179
Why do you give up your dream just for a girl?

33:46.280 --> 33:47.948
"Just for a girl?"

33:47.949 --> 33:49.208
That's my precious daughter!

33:49.209 --> 33:51.850
My son is precious too.

33:51.879 --> 33:54.188
How did she seduce my innocent son...

33:54.189 --> 33:55.820
and drag him down so that he wouldn't go to the US?

33:55.919 --> 33:58.389
Who dragged him down?

33:58.459 --> 34:00.928
It was your son who scooped up the water...

34:00.929 --> 34:02.760
like a servant when our house was flooded...

34:02.859 --> 34:04.198
to win my daughter's heart!

34:04.199 --> 34:05.429
You have no idea.

34:05.560 --> 34:08.729
Also, my Sol wasn't interested in him at all.

34:08.730 --> 34:10.699
You're being ridiculous.

34:11.070 --> 34:12.600
Hey. Is this true?

34:13.709 --> 34:14.969
- Goodness.
- Yes.

34:15.040 --> 34:16.240
I begged her to like me.

34:16.270 --> 34:17.408
See?

34:17.409 --> 34:19.510
Keep your mouth closed, prick.

34:19.840 --> 34:21.510
"Innocent," my foot.

34:21.879 --> 34:24.419
He rented an R-rated video when he was underage.

34:24.780 --> 34:26.548
He rented "Basic Instincts..."

34:26.549 --> 34:28.718
for a month and watched it over and over again...

34:28.719 --> 34:30.959
until the tape is distorted.

34:30.960 --> 34:32.219
- For goodness' sake.
- Really?

34:36.529 --> 34:39.599
Gosh. I'm sick and tired of hearing...

34:39.600 --> 34:41.429
- about "Basic Instincts." - No. Don't listen to them.

34:42.900 --> 34:44.540
- Don't listen to them.
- Okay.

34:44.739 --> 34:45.839
I watched it.

34:46.339 --> 34:47.969
I watched the movie!

34:48.310 --> 34:49.440
- Dad.
- Satisfied?

34:49.739 --> 34:50.909
For goodness' sake.

34:52.380 --> 34:55.408
Besides eating and sleeping, Sun Jae only cared...

34:55.409 --> 34:57.179
about swimming.

34:57.250 --> 34:58.750
He had no interest in women.

34:59.080 --> 35:00.520
Not even a little bit.

35:00.790 --> 35:03.319
Not even this much he was interested in them.

35:03.350 --> 35:05.460
- Same here!
- He was truly innocent!

35:05.589 --> 35:07.489
He was pure like oxygen.

35:07.960 --> 35:09.130
Oxygen!

35:12.330 --> 35:13.400
Let's go.

35:16.529 --> 35:18.170
Dad. We can't leave like this.

35:18.339 --> 35:20.368
You're too naive. Come on out.

35:20.369 --> 35:21.838
Dad. We can't leave like this.

35:21.839 --> 35:23.678
- Hurry up!
- No, I can't.

35:23.679 --> 35:25.710
- Why do you insist?
- Come on, Dad!

35:44.799 --> 35:47.069
No. Why are they...

35:48.469 --> 35:49.630
"Innocent?"

35:50.130 --> 35:51.468
"Pure like oxygen?"

35:51.469 --> 35:54.770
Pervert!

35:54.869 --> 35:55.909
You...

35:56.310 --> 35:58.540
What's going on?

35:58.839 --> 36:00.009
What's wrong?

36:00.279 --> 36:01.408
Mom, actually...

36:01.409 --> 36:03.509
Stop!

36:07.790 --> 36:08.949
These are mine.

36:10.719 --> 36:12.859
These are all mine.

36:12.860 --> 36:14.059
That doesn't make sense, does it?

36:14.060 --> 36:16.289
It's because I still feel hot in my heart!

36:16.290 --> 36:17.400
Stop it.

36:18.199 --> 36:21.170
I get that he's an adult now, but still.

36:21.369 --> 36:23.770
Look. There must be hundreds of them!

36:24.270 --> 36:27.068
Sol. You can never see a wolf like him...

36:27.069 --> 36:28.738
with such a dark intent. Never.

36:28.739 --> 36:29.968
I'll never let you!

36:29.969 --> 36:31.138
Gosh.

36:31.139 --> 36:34.650
Thank you for being against their relationship. Yes.

36:36.279 --> 36:37.580
I told you to let go of him!

36:38.549 --> 36:41.048
You too. Don't date a girl...

36:41.049 --> 36:42.690
from such a bossy family. Never!

36:44.060 --> 36:45.420
- Let's go.
- But...

36:46.560 --> 36:48.088
These aren't really mine.

36:48.089 --> 36:50.460
- Who cares?
- Please hear us out.

36:50.799 --> 36:51.899
- Sun Jae.
- Sol.

36:51.900 --> 36:53.230
- Sun Jae!
- What are you doing?

36:53.630 --> 36:54.698
- Let it go!
- Sun Jae!

36:54.699 --> 36:55.769
- Sol!
- Let go!

36:55.770 --> 36:56.798
- Sun Jae!
- Sol!

36:56.799 --> 36:58.269
Dad, come on. Sol.

36:58.270 --> 36:59.369
Sol!

37:01.969 --> 37:03.569
Sun Jae!

37:05.980 --> 37:07.610
Are they furious?

37:07.779 --> 37:11.419
I explained to them that you were not such a person,

37:11.420 --> 37:12.520
but it didn't work.

37:14.420 --> 37:15.449
What should we do?

37:18.819 --> 37:20.560
By the way, Sun Jae,

37:21.330 --> 37:22.589
those...

37:23.489 --> 37:24.759
aren't yours, right?

37:25.929 --> 37:27.529
Of course not!

37:29.199 --> 37:30.329
Come on.

37:30.330 --> 37:31.669
Of all people, how could you think...

37:31.670 --> 37:34.909
Right. I do believe you.

37:36.369 --> 37:37.739
- Do you believe me 100 percent?
- What?

37:40.139 --> 37:41.909
Yes. Sure.

37:42.480 --> 37:44.179
I believe you.

37:45.420 --> 37:46.679
You don't believe me.

37:46.980 --> 37:48.020
I can't let this pass.

37:48.589 --> 37:51.119
I'll give you an explanation within an hour, so wait.

37:54.290 --> 37:55.330
Okay.

37:56.259 --> 37:59.360
How did they get into my bag?

38:01.000 --> 38:03.330
So, they...

38:04.440 --> 38:06.400
I have to focus.

38:17.480 --> 38:18.650
Is that how they got in?

38:20.690 --> 38:21.790
(Calling Cho Rong)

38:22.319 --> 38:23.888
- The phone is turned off.
- Why isn't he picking up?

38:23.889 --> 38:25.020
Please leave a message...

38:27.989 --> 38:30.060
- Hey, Sun Jae.
- Hey. About those con...

38:30.860 --> 38:32.299
Those con...

38:32.400 --> 38:33.629
- "Con?" - You know those.

38:33.630 --> 38:35.000
"Con?" What do you mean?

38:35.400 --> 38:36.500
Unicorns?

38:36.699 --> 38:37.799
No.

38:38.040 --> 38:39.769
There were hundreds of them in a black plastic bag.

38:39.770 --> 38:40.770
Don't you know them?

38:41.170 --> 38:42.839
Right. Those.

38:43.339 --> 38:44.440
How did you know about those?

38:45.210 --> 38:47.908
Actually, Cho Rong was worried sick because he lost them...

38:47.909 --> 38:49.079
while they are a gift for his brother.

38:49.080 --> 38:50.279
Were they Cho Rong's?

38:50.650 --> 38:51.980
For goodness' sake!

38:53.319 --> 38:56.020
Cho Rong's phone was off. Where is he?

39:07.770 --> 39:08.869
Dad.

39:08.900 --> 39:10.969
- What?
- You came all the way here.

39:14.009 --> 39:15.809
So, this boy, Sun Jae...

39:15.810 --> 39:18.678
No. He knows enough now,

39:18.679 --> 39:20.079
so he's a grownup.

39:20.080 --> 39:24.049
So, Sun Jae, a grown-up man has summoned us...

39:24.179 --> 39:26.679
to get the record straight.

39:26.719 --> 39:29.520
Let's resolve the misunderstandings between the two sides now.

39:31.119 --> 39:32.460
Here's what started.

39:32.920 --> 39:35.830
Who watched...

39:36.790 --> 39:37.960
"Basic Instincts?"

39:39.759 --> 39:41.069
I was the one who rented it,

39:42.100 --> 39:43.199
but I didn't watch it.

39:43.630 --> 39:46.040
Are you saying that you drank but it's not a DUI case?

39:47.440 --> 39:48.440
Look!

39:50.110 --> 39:53.409
We have a DVD player, so we can't watch VHS tapes.

39:54.080 --> 39:55.149
He's right.

39:55.150 --> 39:56.750
Why did you rent it, then?

39:56.949 --> 39:58.020
It's because...

39:58.679 --> 40:01.388
I grabbed whatever because my heart was throbbing.

40:01.389 --> 40:03.488
Why did your heart throb while renting a video?

40:03.489 --> 40:04.819
Do you have arrhythmia?

40:05.319 --> 40:06.460
It was because...

40:08.759 --> 40:10.389
Sol at the counter was so pretty.

40:15.400 --> 40:16.900
What are you talking about...

40:17.270 --> 40:18.270
You brat.

40:18.271 --> 40:19.699
Why are you smiling with your eyes?

40:21.869 --> 40:24.278
Gosh. You're so soft.

40:24.279 --> 40:28.549
You're saying you were blinded by my granddaughter's beauty.

40:29.710 --> 40:31.980
Sure. That's possible.

40:33.179 --> 40:34.719
Okay. Moving on.

40:34.819 --> 40:37.988
Who will explain the reason why you were naked...

40:37.989 --> 40:39.690
in the morning?

40:40.259 --> 40:41.488
Actually, Grandma,

40:41.489 --> 40:43.900
the shirt got ripped while I tried to wipe something off.

40:44.060 --> 40:46.000
What? You ripped it?

40:46.360 --> 40:48.830
You are unbelievable!

40:51.040 --> 40:53.169
She did rip off the shirt, but nothing happened.

40:53.170 --> 40:54.170
Hey.

40:55.540 --> 40:57.069
She's strong.

40:57.610 --> 40:59.739
- Dad.
- "It's love, not an affair?"

40:59.779 --> 41:01.948
It's true. I fell asleep while watching a movie.

41:01.949 --> 41:03.179
I drooled, so...

41:04.920 --> 41:07.750
Will you trust me, Grandma?

41:08.350 --> 41:12.759
Of course. I trust what my puppy says.

41:13.290 --> 41:14.860
Okay. Moving on.

41:16.389 --> 41:20.029
The pile of this stuff from the bag.

41:20.199 --> 41:21.270
Goodness, Mom.

41:21.969 --> 41:23.699
- Please cover them.
- Anyway.

41:23.770 --> 41:28.310
In what mindset did you prepare more than hundreds of them?

41:29.239 --> 41:31.980
Those aren't really mine. Those are my friend's stuff.

41:33.110 --> 41:35.250
Liar! Why would we believe that?

41:35.610 --> 41:36.750
I have a witness.

41:36.909 --> 41:38.520
He is supposed to be here. Hold on.

41:38.949 --> 41:40.650
- I'm on my way.
- Wait a minute.

41:40.889 --> 41:42.019
"A witness?"

41:42.020 --> 41:44.290
Did you ask the owner of those to come over?

41:44.319 --> 41:45.460
Yes.

41:45.659 --> 41:46.719
He'll be here soon.

41:48.159 --> 41:49.230
Darn it.

41:49.759 --> 41:51.929
Why isn't he coming? This is insane.

41:53.130 --> 41:55.199
Gosh. You fool.

41:55.469 --> 41:57.069
What the heck is this?

41:57.230 --> 41:58.469
Hey, let's just go.

41:59.469 --> 42:01.440
No, Dad. Hold on.

42:01.710 --> 42:04.508
Right. A clumsy explanation will only embarrass you more.

42:04.509 --> 42:06.178
Also, I have to go to an aerobics class.

42:06.179 --> 42:07.379
- Let's go now.
- Mom.

42:07.380 --> 42:09.908
- Mom, just a little longer.
- Let's wrap it up...

42:09.909 --> 42:11.379
because I have to go to the cultural centre too.

42:11.380 --> 42:13.079
- Please wait.
- Grandma.

42:13.080 --> 42:14.389
- Just another three minutes.
- Sun Jae.

42:32.739 --> 42:34.610
Hello. Well...

42:35.170 --> 42:36.339
Where are...

42:36.409 --> 42:38.440
my condoms?

42:43.310 --> 42:45.080
We're safe now!

42:48.219 --> 42:50.960
It's a bit blurry.

42:52.259 --> 42:54.330
It's Kim Young Soo.

42:55.560 --> 42:58.460
I think he tried to pull over in a place with no security camera.

42:58.630 --> 43:01.029
Fortunately, he didn't notice the camera blocked by the tree.

43:02.369 --> 43:03.469
And...

43:05.540 --> 43:08.170
Here. He came back after 15 minutes and left.

43:09.739 --> 43:11.480
We can't track his location after that.

43:11.679 --> 43:13.139
I think he took the national highway where there's no security camera.

43:13.409 --> 43:15.278
He pulled over onto the shoulder...

43:15.279 --> 43:17.150
and came back as long as 15 minutes later?

43:18.520 --> 43:19.920
Did he meet someone?

43:20.650 --> 43:21.920
Was there an ATM by any chance?

43:22.089 --> 43:23.219
There was a pay phone.

43:24.290 --> 43:26.889
There was a pay phone about 1km from here.

43:27.830 --> 43:29.429
I requested the outgoing call records...

43:29.730 --> 43:31.330
for that time frame from the telephone office.

43:33.400 --> 43:34.428
What is this place for?

43:34.429 --> 43:36.329
They sell livestock feed.

43:36.330 --> 43:39.639
The owner used to run an illegal slaughterhouse.

43:41.369 --> 43:44.979
He uses anaesthetic for animals every time he commits a crime.

43:44.980 --> 43:46.440
Was he trying to get it there?

43:47.779 --> 43:50.549
I think he's preparing for the next crime.

43:58.759 --> 43:59.818
I like your confidence.

43:59.819 --> 44:00.889
I like your confidence.

44:01.929 --> 44:04.129
Let's do it. Show me.

44:04.130 --> 44:05.159
Show me your confidence.

44:05.330 --> 44:07.830
There you go. It's good.

44:08.600 --> 44:09.600
Good.

44:11.670 --> 44:12.670
Gosh.

44:20.380 --> 44:21.880
This is nice. Smile.

44:22.380 --> 44:23.380
Gosh, this is great.

44:27.589 --> 44:28.649
Yes!

44:28.650 --> 44:30.249
My hair doesn't look so good.

44:30.250 --> 44:31.259
- Your hair?
- Yes.

44:31.589 --> 44:32.719
It looks nice.

44:33.989 --> 44:35.860
You look cool. You're the best.

44:36.029 --> 44:37.290
Don't do that.

44:38.900 --> 44:40.630
Excuse me.

44:41.270 --> 44:43.600
Don't take pictures of my prince.

44:43.770 --> 44:44.939
I'm texting.

44:44.940 --> 44:46.099
Is he a celebrity or what?

44:46.100 --> 44:47.399
- What's wrong with him?
- This is unbelievable.

44:47.400 --> 44:48.940
Don't go overboard. Come on.

44:50.739 --> 44:52.339
Oh, my goodness.

44:53.009 --> 44:54.250
He's so handsome.

44:54.949 --> 44:56.649
The guy next to him looks like carp-shaped bread.

44:56.650 --> 44:57.979
No. He looks like a sea squirt.

44:57.980 --> 44:59.380
- But he's so good-looking!
- He's so good-looking!

44:59.880 --> 45:01.049
Thank you so much.

45:01.819 --> 45:02.889
He said, "Thank you so much!"

45:03.250 --> 45:04.759
Carp-shaped bread? A sea squirt?

45:06.159 --> 45:07.860
Gosh, I envy you so much.

45:12.500 --> 45:13.699
Yes. What's the matter?

45:16.400 --> 45:17.400
What?

45:17.401 --> 45:19.699
Is the owner of the white truck that was in front of my house...

45:19.940 --> 45:21.969
- Kim Young Soo?
- Yes.

45:22.339 --> 45:24.678
It means he's been roaming around me,

45:24.679 --> 45:26.178
waiting for a chance.

45:26.179 --> 45:27.779
They'll contact you soon.

45:28.009 --> 45:29.650
But I came to warn you beforehand.

45:30.549 --> 45:32.480
- Thank you.
- Considering the situation,

45:32.980 --> 45:34.649
don't you have to tell your family and evade him beforehand...

45:34.650 --> 45:35.889
until he's caught?

45:36.690 --> 45:37.719
No, I can't.

45:38.319 --> 45:40.089
If he had decided to find me,

45:40.360 --> 45:42.460
he'd do it no matter where I am.

45:42.589 --> 45:45.230
What on earth happens because of him? Why are you being like this?

45:48.000 --> 45:49.199
You can't give me an answer to this either, can you?

45:50.000 --> 45:52.770
So please don't tell anyone and keep it a secret.

45:54.069 --> 45:55.210
For free?

45:55.440 --> 45:56.810
You should treat me to a meal at least.

45:57.040 --> 45:58.580
Okay. I'll treat you to a meal.

45:59.880 --> 46:00.880
What?

46:04.150 --> 46:05.179
Sun Jae.

46:05.520 --> 46:06.549
Hi, friend.

46:08.420 --> 46:09.750
Why would you treat him to a meal?

46:10.119 --> 46:11.119
Well,

46:11.560 --> 46:13.389
that's...

46:13.819 --> 46:15.029
Why are you here?

46:16.860 --> 46:18.299
I came to get my dad's underwear back.

46:19.460 --> 46:20.460
Look.

46:21.400 --> 46:22.429
Right.

46:23.369 --> 46:25.270
I took it by mistake last time.

46:27.139 --> 46:28.739
I said I would treat him to a meal because I was sorry.

46:31.710 --> 46:32.739
Let's go.

46:33.310 --> 46:34.409
I'll treat you to a meal.

46:35.080 --> 46:36.509
Why would you do that?

46:36.549 --> 46:39.650
I don't want my girlfriend to eat with her ex-boyfriend.

46:40.380 --> 46:41.920
- Why?
- What?

46:42.290 --> 46:43.290
Thank you.

46:49.159 --> 46:50.860
Don't visit Sol from now on.

46:52.029 --> 46:53.500
Let me just eat, friend.

46:55.199 --> 46:57.868
We were never friends. Why do you keep calling me that?

46:57.869 --> 47:00.069
We even slept together. Of course, we're friends.

47:02.110 --> 47:04.980
So Sol is your girlfriend?

47:08.750 --> 47:10.310
She's my girlfriend now.

47:11.520 --> 47:12.520
(Soju)

47:16.089 --> 47:17.119
Congratulations.

47:25.630 --> 47:27.969
You think it will last forever, right?

47:28.730 --> 47:29.799
It doesn't.

47:29.929 --> 47:31.900
Look at me. She dumped me only after two weeks.

47:32.900 --> 47:34.170
You should treat her right while she's your girlfriend.

47:36.810 --> 47:37.839
Whatever.

47:38.310 --> 47:40.409
What's the secret...

47:41.409 --> 47:42.949
- she told you not to tell anyone?
- What?

47:43.350 --> 47:44.420
Did you hear it earlier?

47:44.920 --> 47:46.948
Did you say you would treat me to food to ask me about that?

47:46.949 --> 47:48.549
Why would I do it then?

47:50.949 --> 47:52.060
What can I do?

47:52.690 --> 47:54.789
She told me not to tell anyone.

47:54.790 --> 47:57.360
I'm not "anyone."

47:58.230 --> 47:59.359
I don't know.

47:59.360 --> 48:00.860
I'm never going to tell you.

48:01.100 --> 48:03.770
So ask your own girlfriend.

48:07.710 --> 48:09.940
I'll pay for it before I go. Enjoy your food.

48:10.670 --> 48:11.739
Are you leaving?

48:12.339 --> 48:13.880
I hate eating alone.

48:14.909 --> 48:15.949
Are you a kid?

48:23.290 --> 48:24.319
You...

48:24.790 --> 48:26.889
Don't roam around Sol.

48:27.319 --> 48:29.759
There's a reason for it.

48:30.089 --> 48:31.959
You don't even know.

48:31.960 --> 48:33.699
- What's the reason?
- It's a secret.

48:34.029 --> 48:35.600
My goodness.

48:37.799 --> 48:38.900
I'm jealous of you, you punk.

48:39.540 --> 48:40.739
You should've done better, you punk.

48:43.069 --> 48:44.139
You know what?

48:45.279 --> 48:46.310
I think...

48:46.940 --> 48:48.480
I liked her a lot.

48:49.449 --> 48:52.619
So what? I don't care.

48:55.549 --> 48:57.989
Is she really going after a month?

49:00.960 --> 49:02.089
I don't know, you punk.

49:06.830 --> 49:08.369
Action.

49:08.469 --> 49:09.698
("My Daughter's Affair As Revenge")

49:09.699 --> 49:10.900
What do you want to do now?

49:11.299 --> 49:12.899
- Shall we eat?
- Shall we?

49:12.900 --> 49:14.439
- What do you want to do after that?
- After that...

49:14.440 --> 49:17.568
- How dare you do that?
- What are you doing?

49:17.569 --> 49:19.508
- Hey!
- Hey!

49:19.509 --> 49:21.849
- It's not what you think.
- Hey.

49:21.850 --> 49:22.880
It's not good.

49:23.509 --> 49:25.949
How dare you cheat on my daughter?

49:26.049 --> 49:28.250
- Hey!
- Get him!

49:28.920 --> 49:29.949
Wait!

49:31.219 --> 49:32.589
Wrap up the shooting!

49:33.389 --> 49:35.360
- Why?
- The guy who cheats on his wife.

49:35.460 --> 49:37.460
Hwang Jung Ho will make a cameo appearance and play it!

49:37.759 --> 49:38.899
What? Hwang Jung Ho?

49:38.900 --> 49:41.059
Hwang Jung Ho who received Best Actor at the Cannes Film Festival?

49:41.060 --> 49:42.198
Wrap up the shooting immediately...

49:42.199 --> 49:44.468
and set the date again according to his schedule.

49:44.469 --> 49:46.439
- Yes. This is amazing.
- This is incredible.

49:46.440 --> 49:47.839
- Oh, my gosh.
- Ma'am.

49:48.239 --> 49:49.939
- It's Hwang Jung Ho.
- It's Hwang Jung Ho.

49:49.940 --> 49:52.238
It's Hwang Jung Ho.

49:52.239 --> 49:54.750
- Hwang Jung Ho!
- Hwang Jung Ho!

49:54.850 --> 49:57.448
- Hwang Jung Ho!
- Hwang Jung Ho!

49:57.449 --> 49:58.919
Director.

49:58.920 --> 50:00.448
Does it mean I'm fired?

50:00.449 --> 50:02.920
I don't usually replace actors.

50:03.020 --> 50:04.718
But it's Hwang Jung Ho who went to the Cannes Film Festival.

50:04.719 --> 50:06.818
You understand it, right? I like your mindset.

50:06.819 --> 50:09.630
- Hwang Jung Ho!
- Hwang Jung Ho!

50:09.730 --> 50:12.299
- Hwang Jung Ho!
- Hwang Jung Ho!

50:12.500 --> 50:15.270
- Hwang Jung Ho!
- Hwang Jung Ho!

50:15.369 --> 50:18.069
- Hwang Jung Ho!
- Hwang Jung Ho!

50:18.199 --> 50:20.000
- Hwang Jung Ho!
- Dinner is on me!

50:30.909 --> 50:31.948
(Pain relief patch)

50:31.949 --> 50:33.080
Put this on.

50:33.449 --> 50:35.089
They beat you everywhere.

50:40.190 --> 50:41.759
Don't tell my mom about this.

50:42.659 --> 50:44.929
Be happy that you're fired.

50:45.130 --> 50:46.830
You might have broken your bone if you had continued.

50:47.130 --> 50:48.630
Is that how you comfort people?

50:48.869 --> 50:50.069
Don't pity me.

50:50.500 --> 50:51.699
Do you think I'm pitiful?

50:52.500 --> 50:53.940
What's pitiful about you?

50:54.639 --> 50:56.468
The broadcasters who don't recognize your talent...

50:56.469 --> 50:58.380
and look down on you are much more pitiful.

50:59.239 --> 51:01.310
You look like Hyun Bin and Gong Yoo to my eyes.

51:02.009 --> 51:03.049
What?

51:03.710 --> 51:04.819
Gosh.

51:05.480 --> 51:06.920
That's not right.

51:07.350 --> 51:08.549
I have a conscience too.

51:09.549 --> 51:10.650
No.

51:10.889 --> 51:14.060
You're a man who is like 24k pure gold to me.

51:14.889 --> 51:16.759
You're like a gold bar.

51:17.589 --> 51:18.699
A gold bar?

51:19.159 --> 51:20.900
A gold bar, my foot.

51:24.940 --> 51:28.040
By the way, I thought things were going well with Cho Rong.

51:28.739 --> 51:30.939
- Who said that?
- You guys were giggling...

51:30.940 --> 51:32.178
and overjoyed.

51:32.179 --> 51:33.779
I couldn't bear to look at you because I got goosebumps.

51:34.080 --> 51:36.249
Look at this. Do you see it?

51:36.250 --> 51:37.380
I got goosebumps.

51:38.150 --> 51:40.319
What? I got you.

51:41.219 --> 51:42.219
What are you talking about?

51:42.449 --> 51:43.920
You're jealous, aren't you?

51:44.049 --> 51:45.819
What do you mean I'm jealous?

51:46.860 --> 51:47.889
You are.

51:48.190 --> 51:50.429
Why are you stuttering? Why is your face red?

51:51.029 --> 51:52.559
Go away.

51:52.560 --> 51:54.770
- Why is it red?
- Don't touch me.

52:08.210 --> 52:10.080
Go!

52:26.429 --> 52:27.968
Geum, go inside quickly.

52:27.969 --> 52:29.369
No. You go in first.

52:29.699 --> 52:31.869
I'm okay. You go in first.

52:32.239 --> 52:34.039
You should survive at least.

52:34.040 --> 52:35.139
No way!

52:35.339 --> 52:36.469
How can I try to survive alone?

52:47.049 --> 52:48.089
We're safe.

52:48.250 --> 52:50.020
Why is it not leaving?

52:52.960 --> 52:53.960
By the way,

52:54.420 --> 52:55.790
why did you want me to hide alone?

52:56.929 --> 52:59.060
I was worried you might be bitten.

52:59.799 --> 53:00.830
That's ridiculous.

53:01.130 --> 53:03.469
You almost got bitten to death by that big dog.

53:05.969 --> 53:06.969
Geum.

53:07.739 --> 53:08.770
You're so...

53:26.819 --> 53:28.759
Gosh! What the heck?

53:31.360 --> 53:32.400
What the heck?

53:34.130 --> 53:35.130
Good morning.

53:35.199 --> 53:36.230
What?

53:36.270 --> 53:38.239
I can't believe they're my friends.

53:39.400 --> 53:41.810
Hey, why was I sleeping with this guy here?

53:43.210 --> 53:45.109
Do you not remember?

53:45.110 --> 53:46.239
Do you not?

53:51.080 --> 53:52.080
Sol.

53:52.980 --> 53:54.819
Why are there so many Sols here?

53:54.850 --> 53:56.548
- Sol.
- Let's go.

53:56.549 --> 53:58.859
- Why are you hurt?
- Sol.

53:58.860 --> 54:00.888
- I like you!
- Im Sol!

54:00.889 --> 54:03.888
- Im Sol!
- Im Sol!

54:03.889 --> 54:05.599
Sol.

54:05.600 --> 54:06.798
Im Sol.

54:06.799 --> 54:12.569
Don't go

54:12.600 --> 54:14.839
I wish it was me

54:15.440 --> 54:19.109
I wish you loved me

54:19.110 --> 54:21.279
- Don't cry, you punk.
- I wish it was me

54:24.750 --> 54:25.850
No way.

54:28.889 --> 54:29.989
Gosh.

54:30.089 --> 54:31.150
- Look.
- This is crazy.

54:32.819 --> 54:33.819
What?

54:34.420 --> 54:35.860
Darn it.

54:36.529 --> 54:37.730
What are these?

54:38.360 --> 54:39.659
You're best friends now.

54:40.000 --> 54:42.829
No wonder. You both have a weird taste for women.

54:42.830 --> 54:44.000
You must click.

54:44.130 --> 54:45.270
- What's wrong with Sol?
- What's wrong with Sol?

54:47.839 --> 54:49.509
Don't you ever drink together.

54:50.270 --> 54:51.909
I'm sensitive today.

54:52.509 --> 54:54.239
So please get lost. Okay?

54:57.509 --> 54:58.619
My goodness.

54:59.250 --> 55:00.679
I should just cook hangover ramyeon.

55:04.719 --> 55:05.759
Two packets?

55:06.319 --> 55:07.389
Three.

55:10.560 --> 55:11.860
Those punks.

55:17.600 --> 55:19.239
What's the secret she told you about?

55:20.339 --> 55:21.670
Don't you think I should know?

55:22.670 --> 55:23.909
What on earth is that?

55:25.610 --> 55:26.879
My dad is chasing after Kim Young Soo.

55:26.880 --> 55:28.279
So mind your own business.

55:29.380 --> 55:30.850
That's all I can say.

55:32.119 --> 55:33.319
Kim Young Soo.

55:45.060 --> 55:46.500
Why are you taking them off?

55:47.299 --> 55:48.500
I put up this place for rent.

55:49.869 --> 55:52.670
I'm going to quit the band and go back to my hometown.

55:53.699 --> 55:54.770
All of a sudden?

55:55.310 --> 55:56.409
Are you all right?

55:59.080 --> 56:00.339
What if I'm not all right?

56:01.580 --> 56:03.610
The club fired us. So today is our last performance.

56:04.710 --> 56:06.949
But we won't even be able to do it because Dong Seob quit the band.

56:09.290 --> 56:12.159
It's your last performance. You should do it.

56:12.319 --> 56:13.560
Do you want me to promote it?

56:15.830 --> 56:18.929
I can't sing, but I have a good look.

56:19.000 --> 56:21.869
I'll fill the venue with an audience. How about that?

56:25.069 --> 56:26.069
You?

56:26.699 --> 56:27.699
Really?

56:38.279 --> 56:39.319
(Mirae Livestock Medicine)

57:02.239 --> 57:03.839
(Anaesthetic for animals)

57:17.020 --> 57:18.049
Darn it.

57:19.889 --> 57:21.158
It's good to see you, Young Soo.

57:21.159 --> 57:22.230
Kim Young Soo.

57:22.730 --> 57:24.630
You're caught, you punk.

57:27.360 --> 57:28.369
What did you say?

57:28.600 --> 57:29.799
He was caught?

57:30.029 --> 57:31.130
Yes, Sol.

57:31.270 --> 57:33.900
It's all over now. You don't have to worry.

57:35.670 --> 57:38.310
Okay. Thank you.

57:46.380 --> 57:47.819
It's really over.

57:51.889 --> 57:53.520
Today is In Hyuk's last performance.

57:53.889 --> 57:54.989
Do you want to watch it together?

57:58.360 --> 58:00.060
- Let's go.
- Yes.

58:12.080 --> 58:13.779
Did Sun Jae not come yet?

58:19.319 --> 58:20.779
There are usually not many people when we perform.

58:20.949 --> 58:22.089
It's unusual today.

58:22.690 --> 58:24.449
It's thanks to my friend.

58:24.960 --> 58:27.489
Princesses, please come and watch these cool guys' performance.

58:28.529 --> 58:29.560
Are you ready?

58:30.529 --> 58:31.529
Let's go, guys.

58:40.040 --> 58:41.969
- Oh, my gosh!
- Goodness!

58:48.139 --> 58:49.210
Hello.

58:49.549 --> 58:52.150
So many people are here. Thank you.

58:52.850 --> 58:55.549
Actually, today is our last performance.

58:55.850 --> 58:58.860
That's why we're joined by a special guest vocalist.

58:59.190 --> 59:00.290
Please give him a hand.

59:11.230 --> 59:14.500
The first song is made by our guest vocalist.

59:15.409 --> 59:16.540
You might never get a chance...

59:16.610 --> 59:19.639
to perform on stage because of me.

59:19.779 --> 59:21.409
It's "Sonaki."

59:33.460 --> 59:38.560
I didn't want it to stop

59:39.500 --> 59:44.670
On the day you first came to me

59:46.600 --> 59:50.170
I didn't want you to be the rain

59:50.369 --> 59:53.710
That soaks me wet only momentarily

59:54.040 --> 59:58.580
I've prayed so hard

01:00:00.080 --> 01:00:02.750
Do you know how I feel?

01:00:02.920 --> 01:00:08.189
I've dreamt of you every day

01:00:08.190 --> 01:00:13.159
My heart is soaked in you again today

01:00:14.460 --> 01:00:18.028
You are a gift

01:00:18.029 --> 01:00:21.568
From the sky

01:00:21.569 --> 01:00:26.179
When you're all alone in this world

01:00:26.279 --> 01:00:28.750
I'll protect you

01:00:28.850 --> 01:00:31.409
Thank you for staying alive.

01:00:32.350 --> 01:00:34.380
You should live your life today.

01:00:34.980 --> 01:00:36.190
Because it's a great day.

01:00:37.190 --> 01:00:38.690
It rained when I saw you for the first time.

01:00:39.860 --> 01:00:40.920
I liked it that day.

01:00:41.360 --> 01:00:42.460
I like you...

01:00:43.290 --> 01:00:44.360
a lot.

01:00:47.600 --> 01:00:48.600
Sol.

01:00:49.330 --> 01:00:50.630
Stop running away from me.

01:00:51.500 --> 01:00:52.639
Just pursue your feelings for me.

01:00:56.969 --> 01:00:58.480
If I end up dying to save you,

01:01:02.480 --> 01:01:03.549
I'll be fine with that.

01:01:19.730 --> 01:01:22.369
Sun Jae. It's all over.

01:01:23.569 --> 01:01:25.339
We have a future now.

01:01:26.839 --> 01:01:31.069
I haven't forgotten even the smallest memory

01:01:31.239 --> 01:01:34.379
That you gave me

01:01:34.380 --> 01:01:37.750
I think about you again today

01:01:37.980 --> 01:01:42.049
You who are a gift

01:01:43.119 --> 01:01:45.219
To me

01:02:02.139 --> 01:02:03.170
It was amazing!

01:02:24.690 --> 01:02:25.759
Yes, Sol.

01:02:26.429 --> 01:02:29.270
It's all over now. You don't have to worry.

01:02:40.880 --> 01:02:43.909
(Epilogue)

01:02:44.009 --> 01:02:45.448
They say if you catch a falling cherry blossom petal,

01:02:45.449 --> 01:02:46.679
your wish will be granted.

01:02:47.880 --> 01:02:49.589
Let's make a wish. Close your eyes.

01:02:51.719 --> 01:02:54.759
I hope my dear Sol stays happy for a long time.

01:02:55.020 --> 01:02:58.290
I hope my dear Sun Jae stays happy for a long time.

01:02:58.929 --> 01:03:00.159
- I hope we stay happy together...
- I hope we stay happy together...

01:03:00.529 --> 01:03:02.299
- for a long time.
- for a long time.

01:03:24.489 --> 01:03:27.319
(Lovely Runner)

01:03:27.690 --> 01:03:29.830
What happens here that day?

01:03:31.130 --> 01:03:32.500
Why are you suddenly being like this?

01:03:32.860 --> 01:03:35.028
Someone might carry my girlfriend away. Why?

01:03:35.029 --> 01:03:36.699
- What?
- He put up his house for rent?

01:03:37.069 --> 01:03:38.500
Do you know where his house is in his hometown?

01:03:39.000 --> 01:03:40.040
Danpo-ri?

01:03:40.239 --> 01:03:41.738
Don't cause any trouble for the adults...

01:03:41.739 --> 01:03:43.509
and come back after playing quietly.

01:03:43.940 --> 01:03:45.980
- Soondol!
- If there's the brightest moment...

01:03:46.339 --> 01:03:48.040
in my youth,

01:03:48.750 --> 01:03:50.080
I hope I'm with you.

01:03:50.380 --> 01:03:52.250
I wish tomorrow would never come.

01:03:52.750 --> 01:03:55.750
I wish we could stay here, trapped in this moment.

01:03:56.219 --> 01:03:57.449
I wish you could never go back.

01:03:58.319 --> 01:04:00.989
Sun Jae. What do we do?

01:04:01.764 --> 01:04:03.764
Dramaday.me
